# --- LiDO data currency finding, recorded as project metadata ---
bwb:BWBR0040940 jip:hasDataCurrencyNote """Article-level incoming citation data (other laws and case law citing each article) has been merged in per provision, under each provision's 'lido_citations' field, pulled from LiDO's SPARQL endpoint on 2026-09-09/10. This is INCOMING citations only, who cites each article, not what each article itself cites (see the note inside lido_citations for why). LiDO's indexed version of UAVG tops out at 2021-07-01, five versions behind the actual current 2026-09-01 text used for the article text in this file, so citation counts reflect the older article structure and may not perfectly align with current article numbering, especially for articles added or restructured in the 2026-09-01 amendment.""" .
bwb:BWBR0040940 jip:hasTwoIndexFinding """CONFIRMED: LiDO operates at least two distinct indexes with different currency. The SPARQL endpoint's index for BWBR0040940 is stale at 2021-07-01. The portal's index includes citations current to within days of this project's own compilation date. Any future querying of this law via SPARQL should be treated as potentially incomplete for anything after mid-2021 unless this is independently re-verified.""" .

